WEBVTT

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:05.190
<i>Aided by Jeanne's Regalia of protection,</i>

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.570
<i>Nobunaga defeats Caesar.</i>

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:11.110
<i>His feat immediately spread throughout Owari,</i>

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.930
<i>renewing the citizens' 
spirits after so very long.</i>

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:18.680
Okay, great!

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.040
Slowly!

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.920
Behold the Giant War Armor, Orléans!

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.940
Built from parts salvaged 
from Giant War Armor units

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.180
that fell during the battle with the Takeda,

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.320
this unit is for your use only!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.480
Orléans...

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:40.240
Orléans should be able to maximize 
the powers of the protective Regalia

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:44.420
that you activated in the last battle.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.740
A defensive power...

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.660
Yes...

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.550
With this power, I can protect people.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:52.380
I can do that, too!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.430
Even now, this castle's lord 
barricades himself within.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:38.480
He must be quite the coward.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:39.360
Open the gates!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.150
Wait.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.440
He's unprotected. What a fool!

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:10.900
Well done.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.540
It's impressive to see how many foes

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.260
you can defeat without engaging.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:20.000
Do you presume to have gauged my 
abilities, Gaius Julius Caesar?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.580
I am honored to meet you, Uesugi Kenshin.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:35.380
Nobukatsu-sama!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:44.200
Mitsuhide...

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.990
How could you?!

00:03:57.910 --> 00:03:58.900
Again...

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.880
Now that Nobukatsu-sama is no more,

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:07.490
we have no choice but to entrust the 
Oda clan's future to Nobunaga-sama.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:08.810
It is far from my wish,

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.850
but he has been successful in war.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.580
After many sacrifices,

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.600
the Oda clan is finally uniting 
under Nobu's leadership.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.320
It is everything I wished for...

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.750
Yes, everything I wished for!

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.350
There can be no regrets.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.160
And yet...!

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.010
Mitsuhide...

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:36.240
This is something 
called a "speaker."

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:40.740
Can something like this be of any 
use to the castle's defenses?

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.750
Who knows?

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.140
But if voices can be 
amplified and transmitted,

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.750
we can respond more quickly to the enemy.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:47.990
As for the rest...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.750
What is this stench?!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:53.500
They say, "Never lower your guard,
 even after a victory."

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.730
My betrothed is at a critical juncture.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.760
He must build his energy!

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:09.640
A-ha... this is...

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.960
quite a rousing flavor!

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.920
My betrothed!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:23.890
Please quench this burning 
sensation of mine!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:27.520
Nobunaga isn't here.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.570
What?!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:31.590
He left, saying something 
about calibrating his War Armor.

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:33.500
Hey, what's the matter?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.630
Your face is all red!

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.680
Nothing.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:40.540
And why are you here,
 even though my betrothed is not?

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.570
Huh, why?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:44.590
I hope you aren't trying to use

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.460
your new status as an

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.950
orchestrator to rendezvous 
in your War Armors.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.460
Ren... dez... what?!

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:53.320
Closet perv.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.090
You misunderstand!

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:58.160
I mean, what's the point of 
doing that in War Armors?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.130
Unless you're in the flesh, you—

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.960
Er, I mean, I don't mean anything by that...

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:04.530
What?

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.500
I think this is the first 
time I've seen you smile.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.050
That's how you smile, huh?

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.770
It's not bad.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:15.280
That makes you a worthwhile rival.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.430
But I will not give way easily.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:21.120
My betrothed is <i>my</i> betrothed.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.050
She's got me all wrong.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.130
It's not like I'm...

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.000
Are you ready?

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.280
We'll begin with basic maneuvers.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:38.530
War Armors are not operated, but performed.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.000
Become one with it and perform slowly.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.380
Stay calm.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.970
This is just a practice session.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.160
Nobunaga?!

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:56.890
Why are you here?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.180
Man, I can't stand it!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.170
If you're an orchestrator,

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.880
show that you can move the War 
Armor as if it were your own body!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.850
I'm... sorry.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.820
I'm so jealous.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.760
Will a Giant War Armor ever show up for me?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:18.230
I heard that some chit of a girl 
who can hear the voice of God

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:21.630
was chosen by a Regalia at a 
battle on the Star of the East.

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.540
I'm surprised that a traveler 
from this star was chosen.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.330
If this was fated,

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.570
then I wonder what Sir 
da Vinci is truly doing.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:34.130
It seems we should be mindful of 
his actions for the time being.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:37.490
In the end, this is a mere trifle.

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:40.790
Our true goal lies elsewhere.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.810
When twelve wielders of 
sacred power are assembled,

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.450
the great Holy Grail shall appear,

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:49.260
and the world will be saved 
from the brink of oblivion.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.770
Let us make manifest a sacred world...

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:55.360
...and attain perfect harmony.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.710
Oh, Mitsu.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.700
How is it going?

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.150
Well...

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:13.570
The Regalia won't activate?

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:14.370
Correct.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.180
Otherwise, the War Armor is functional.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:20.690
I doubt it's a problem
 with the War Armor itself.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.000
Why?

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:24.360
Why not?

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:27.090
The sensation I felt when it activated...

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.640
I still remember it so clearly!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.400
I should be able to do this, too!

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.940
I should be able to protect him!

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.610
What was that for?!

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.280
You're annoying!

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.750
What?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.690
Of course the Regalia won't 
respond to your will right now!

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.660
What? You...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.130
You don't have to put it like that!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.070
If Ranmaru cannot use the Regalia,

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:56.890
it will be difficult to 
consider her a war asset.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:58.890
We remain in a bind.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.190
You're exaggerating.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:03.240
How am I exaggerating?

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.010
We won a narrow victory,

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.950
but it cannot be denied
 that Caesar is a major threat.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:12.870
Considering that Western forces 
are after the Regalia, as well,

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.610
the situation is dire.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.520
If we do not act,

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.760
the Star of the East is 
as good as conquered.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:22.210
But it doesn't have to be <i>right</i> now.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.840
You don't have to be so impatient—

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.290
Urgent news!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.540
Urgent, urgent, urgent news!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.230
What is it?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.200
I just heard this now, but...

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:36.110
...the remnants of Takeda's forces,
 now under Caesar,

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.910
have formed an alliance with Uesugi Kenshin!

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:41.380
What?!

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:56.160
Thank you for forming this alliance.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.660
It is nothing to thank me for.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.660
This is to preserve order in a world at war.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:07.450
It seems Lord Shingen told his advisors

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:11.940
to come to you,
 should anything happen to him.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:13.910
Indeed.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:18.410
There is no doubt that this is 
written in Lord Shingen's hand.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:26.420
I am sure Lord Shingen in the heavens 
is gladdened by this alliance.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.120
Lord Shingen was a warlord among warlords,

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.190
possessing both pride and strength.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:36.530
I liked him as a person.

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:38.930
However...

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.140
I dislike you.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.440
That is harsh.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.910
Your nature is not that of a warlord.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.210
Your eyes betray you.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.400
Oh?

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.460
I wonder what your eyes look toward.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.090
Someone doesn't like you.

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:09.070
Caesar, you're so lame!

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:12.970
I don't mind as long as the 
alliance has been forged.

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:17.050
Besides, I love beautiful people,

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.010
even if they dislike me.

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:23.170
Uesugi Kenshin is quite intriguing.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.730
A Takeda-Uesugi alliance? 
That's like cheating.

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.040
If they were to attack...

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.450
Hey, what's the matter?

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.770
What else?!

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:33.930
We're running away!

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.360
The Oda clan is finished!

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.430
Mom, I'm scared!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:41.500
Everything's going to be okay! It'll be fine!

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:46.230
If the combined might of
 Takeda and Uesugi are against us,

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.770
I doubt we have any chance at victory.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.930
However, Nobunaga-sama is a rabid dog

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.500
who will snap at any enemy he comes across.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.010
Given that...

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:57.540
...we have no choice but to take action.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.520
Hayashi spoke to Shibata.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.060
It is probable that...

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.020
Well done, Hatsu.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:05.930
You may go.

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:06.700
Yes, sir!

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:11.660
We were so close to having a 
united Oda clan under Nobu.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:17.040
Hayashi and Shibata
 cannot be allowed to continue.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.110
Why do I feel conflicted?

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.810
My hands are already red with blood.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.310
In that case...!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.350
Mitsuhide.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.410
Ichihime-sama?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.700
May I speak with you?

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:35.510
Certainly.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:41.490
What is the matter?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.360
There is no need to be so formal.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.250
I just wanted to hear your voice.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:49.710
Is that not good enough a reason?

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:50.380
It is, my lady.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.370
There you go again.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.660
You look so stern.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:55.590
What?

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:59.340
You look desperate,
as if cursing or clinging to something.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.090
That's what you look like.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:02.580
I...

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:06.180
If you remain in the shadows, 
you will wither away.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:10.100
Perhaps you are in need of the light.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.090
I...

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:14.360
I do not need the light.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.750
There is someone who is 
deserving of greater light...

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:22.380
I merely build the foundation for his brilliance.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.770
If shadows must exist where light resides,

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.870
I can shoulder that burden in its entirety.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:29.580
I see.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.670
I wish to be the light 
within the shadows.

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:35.360
Will that wish go unheard by you?

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:43.570
Please go back, Ichihime-sama.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.100
If nothing else, I wish you pleasant dreams.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:58.770
Father, Nobu is a fortunate soul.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.830
But I, on the other hand...

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.780
Why won't you activate?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.080
He needs strength more than ever.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.060
You seem to be conflicted.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.060
Da Vinci.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:25.060
You knew this might be the 
key to a Regalia, didn't you?

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.560
That's why you brought me to this star.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.240
Who knows?

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.640
You have joined the banquet

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.570
because of your willpower and inner strength.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:37.950
There you go dodging the question again...

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.970
If you are conflicted about your destiny...

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:44.710
I should pick a card, right?

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:49.430
I see.

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:51.450
The Moon reversed.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:54.530
It means to advance without hesitation.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.960
I'd like to believe that 
I have no hesitation.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.290
But, in truth, you lack something.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.430
For example...

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:03.930
What?

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:08.590
Dad, Nobukatsu...

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.870
Everyone expects me to protect our nation.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.350
Drink, Nobukatsu.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.470
Nobunaga!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.120
Will you come with me?

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:31.630
Sorry, Ranmaru.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:35.130
My mature charm will have the final say.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:39.130
I have cultivated my secret techniques 
through years of fantasies.

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:44.960
I will use my ultimate technique 
to send my betrothed over the moon!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:45.440
Let's go!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:47.140
What?

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.730
What are they doing?

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:12.390
What is necessary for the 
Regalia's activation...

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:15.330
is for you to perceive a true mortal threat.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.980
Da Vinci's analysis may be right,

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:19.630
but we won't know if you just dodge.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.100
I know that.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:22.880
I told you.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:27.640
There's no way the Regalia will 
respond to your will right now.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:30.260
You are too focused on 
the enemy in front of you

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.390
and cannot see your true target.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.620
At least, not the way you are now!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.870
Why do you always talk like that?!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.680
I want to...

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:42.350
I want to protect you!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.250
Protect me?

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.640
Because I...

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:56.090
Now that the Takeda and the 
Uesugi have formed an alliance,

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.410
we are out of time.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.250
Forgive me, but I highly doubt

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.430
that Nobunaga-sama can steer 
us through this crisis!

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:08.630
In the end, we need someone more 
worthy to become the clan lord—

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:09.290
Wait!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:13.210
I believe that now is exactly the

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:16.200
time for Nobunaga-sama to rise 
to the occasion as our clan lord!

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.170
I agree with Hayashi-dono.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:19.170
What?

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:21.420
The Oda should stand united,

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:26.170
and with the clan lord and his advisors, 
 agree to submit to Caesar.

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.560
What are you saying?

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:29.180
Are you mad?!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:31.280
Indeed, we are.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.700
If we continue to fight,

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:37.870
the Oda clan and its people 
will be crushed.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.100
But if we submit,

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.490
at least our clan name will be preserved.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:45.780
We will have to accept living in shame,

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:49.200
but even if we were to face reprimand 
from Nobuhide-sama beyond the grave,

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:53.200
this is the only way to protect the Oda name.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:57.750
I don't remember asking you to protect me!

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:58.890
That's...

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.260
I only know how to move forward.

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:04.190
In both past and future,

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:07.220
my feet exist only to propel me forward.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:12.550
I will go forward to the ends 
of heaven and earth and

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.120
unify them under my rule.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:20.450
And yet, will you simply indulge 
your selfish desire to protect me?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.400
Selfish desire...

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.620
Open your eyes and look!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.130
Look at me!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:28.370
Look at how great a man I am!

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:34.970
I see.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.350
I see, you are...

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:43.890
Come!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.670
I haven't been thinking 
about this the right way.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:52.660
There was no meaning in 
protecting Nobunaga alone.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.740
If you are the Savior-King,

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.370
if you are the one who will 
rule heaven and earth...

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:01.750
I

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.910
will protect heaven and earth!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.640
What is going on?!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.080
This is...

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.700
Well done!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:38.710
Ranmaru, I envy you... just a little bit.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.310
What now?!

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:47.790
Nobu!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:50.940
Nobunaga-sama!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.850
We would like you to become the 
official Clan Lord of the Oda,

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.960
then surrender to Caesar.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.230
It is all to protect the Oda name!

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.960
How dare you make that decision without me?!

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:07.520
How can submitting 
to the enemy protect our name?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.830
Does a name that has lost 
all honor and fallen

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:12.550
into the depths deserve protection?

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:14.830
The answer is no!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:18.680
The Oda name only has meaning when 
it bears the honor of a warrior!

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:20.940
<i>Do you wish to survive</i>

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.820
<i>at the cost of freedom and dignity?</i>

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:27.960
<i>Can one be a warlord if one lives 
in shame and clings to one's name?</i>

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:31.040
<i>Can the people retain their honor</i>

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.990
<i>when their clan lord has fallen to the enemy?</i>

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:33.900
Nobunaga-sama!

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:34.960
<i>Of course not!</i>

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:39.630
<i>The Oda's path lies through 
the raging flames!</i>

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.860
I am a man who only knows 
to keep moving forward.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:45.610
Don't expect me to protect you!

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.570
Cherish the honor of the 
Oda and become a sword!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.880
Become the vanguard 
of our advance!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:58.000
Each of you, I will transform 
your resolve into strength.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:01.330
I <i>will</i> gain dominion over heaven and earth!

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:03.570
Resolve...

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:08.130
If having faith in Nobu is my resolve...

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:12.070
If you cannot abide by this,

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:13.270
slay me where I stand!

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:16.840
Slay me and rule this land,
 this heaven and earth, in my stead!

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:21.770
I am consumed with vengeance.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:24.850
I bear hatred for Caesar 
for killing Nobuhide-sama!

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.820
Without avenging him,
 how can I call myself an advisor?

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:30.120
A man of Oda?

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:40.930
Brother!

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:43.170
Everyone is waiting for you.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.830
We'll fight with you, Nobunaga-sama!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.190
We'll show them how stubborn the Oda are!

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:00.920
I will no longer hesitate.

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:02.920
Brother, here.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:06.880
It is the Oda's inheritance, 
entrusted to me by Father.

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:10.210
He asked me to give it to you 
when you became a man worthy

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:11.890
of being our clan lord.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:13.870
The Bowl of Emptiness.

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:17.860
It is a bowl that embodies 
both absence and presence,

00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:19.410
and so signifies totality.

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:21.350
Hah! My fool of a father

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:25.310
thought <i>I</i> needed to become 
worthy of having this bowl?

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:31.140
Very well!

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:34.320
I accept the Bowl of Emptiness!

00:24:12.270 --> 00:24:14.960
An ever-changing force, storm and fury!

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:18.590
I am the one they know as
 the audacious general of fury!

00:24:19.070 --> 00:24:20.660
Next time: Temperance.

00:24:21.320 --> 00:24:24.510
Asahi, everyone, please watch over me!
